<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal forex reserves up mth/mth Jan '97.</title>
<headline>Portugal forex reserves up mth/mth Jan '97.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's net official foreign exchange reserves rose by $1.215 billion to $21.82 billion in January 1997, from December 1996, the Bank of Portugal said in its latest monthly report.</p>
</text>
